<title>UK: Phytopharm posts pretax loss for year.</title>
<headline>Phytopharm posts pretax loss for year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31, 1996:</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 2.54		   vs 1.10 profit</p>
<p> Pretax loss		564,909		vs 189,188 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   933,886		vs 1,114,106</p>
<p> Operating loss	   685,040		vs 353,306 profit</p>
<p>NOTE: Research and development expenses were 1.18 million stg in current year versus 473,905. The company was floated on the London Stock Exchange in April.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
